 ],
 "risk_profile": "Low (refill). Gamble = durability: a deluded king hurts himself for a glorious charge.",
 "core_rule": {
  "name": "Marrow-Feast & Feeding Frenzy",
  "text": "Marrow-Feast: once per round, after a Mordant unit destroys 1+ enemy models in melee, it returns D3 slain models (Class 1) or heals D3 MIGHT (Class 2–5), never above Starting Strength. Feeding Frenzy: Class 1 Mordant units wholly within 9″ of a friendly Mordant Leader get +1 Attack in melee."
 },
